  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\n\n### Dental Implants\n\n\n\n#### Santa Monica Center for Oral Surgery & Dental Implants can give you new teeth in just one day and your smile and confidence back for the rest of your life.\n\n\n\n### Dental Implants can really change your smile and your life in just one day.\n\n\nTooth loss is extremely common among adults, especially as we age. Rather than living with the discomfort and hassles of dentures, you can enjoy a more natural alternative by choosing dental implants provided by Santa Monica Center for Oral Surgery & Dental Implants.\n\nDental implants can replace one or more missing or damaged teeth with a permanent solution that leaves your smile looking 100% natural and allows you to eat the foods you love again. So why wait any longer to regain your smile and self confidence?\n\n\n## About Dental Implants\n\n\n\n#### What are Dental Implants?\n\n\nDental Implants are a valuable alternative to an uncomfortable prosthesis. The implants themselves are small screws produced from titanium that serve a similar purpose to the roots of natural teeth. They are fused to the jawbone and support over dentures and dental bridges, helping them to perform like our natural teeth would. Once the implants are put in place, your general dentist will be able to place the permanent prosthesis.\n\nGiven the numerous benefits and aesthetic qualities Dental Implants offer, they have become the preferred method of tooth replacement today.\n\n\n#### Who typically has their wisdom teeth removed?\n\n\nWisdom teeth removal services are ideal for patients experiencing pain, worried about tooth decay or wishing to improve the overall health of oral cavity. Contact us today to learn more about how we can assist you.\n\n\n###### Dental Implants\n\n\n\n#### Dental Implants\n\n\n\n###### Procedure\n\n\n\n#### Procedure\n\n\nNeed more information on this procedure book an appointment with us.\n\n\n##### Looking for something else?\n\n\nCheck out our other procedures.\n\nView All\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
